      "speaker_name": "郑鹏",
      "start_ms": 7587,
      "end_ms": 15347,
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "text": "毛竹林基地二万亩 苦竹笋基地二千五百亩",
      "audio_file": "1159ac1e-5819-4f3f-96cf-49510bb1aa78.wav",
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker_id": "pw_320",
      "speaker_name": "林峰",
      "start_ms": 15664,
      "end_ms": 21904,
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "text": "并被收入 读懂中国 中国传媒读本二千零百一十",
      "audio_file": "af1f4f5c-9278-44fa-b806-87641d16d590.wav",
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1219",
      "speaker_name": "梁芬",
      "start_ms": 22396,
      "end_ms": 30796,
      "duration_ms": 8400,
      "text": "山下的草甸适宜高山运动 在海拔三千八百的山凹处",
      "audio_file": "13e52abd-2bca-47ee-8962-74302c2a2481.wav",
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker_id": "pw_468",
      "speaker_name": "朱敏",
      "start_ms": 31252,
      "end_ms": 38692,
      "duration_ms": 7440,
      "text": "一 刘兵著 触摸科学 刘兵学术自选集 福州",
      "audio_file": "2968e23c-069f-403d-9b84-3ee1b77dbfec.wav",
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1044",
      "speaker_name": "郭小华",
      "start_ms": 39507,
      "end_ms": 48987,
      "duration_ms": 9480,
      "text": "辅公祏手下的将领吴骚 孙安等人谋划把他逮起来",
      "audio_file": "3495be58-13cb-4098-878b-7a5a88d1999f.wav",
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1045",
      "speaker_name": "高伟",
      "start_ms": 49760,
      "end_ms": 56960,
      "duration_ms": 7200,
      "text": "有些医院会设有影像医学中心 影像医学部或影像医学科",
      "audio_file": "d22055aa-aa09-4c49-af0d-db54dd35e5d0.wav",
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1016",
      "speaker_name": "周建华",
      "start_ms": 57884,
      "end_ms": 68324,
      "duration_ms": 10440,
      "text": "及平江陵之后 王褒入关 贵游等翕然并学褒书",
      "audio_file": "6a292bf1-a4f8-4e71-b964-fab77598b76f.wav",
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1183",
      "speaker_name": "胡明",
      "start_ms": 68684,
      "end_ms": 75284,
      "duration_ms": 6600,
      "text": "车辆发生事故必须保护现场 而不能离开现场后再向保险公司报案",
      "audio_file": "49e8d7c8-8efa-4853-8738-b57d041cec9f.wav",
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1107",
      "speaker_name": "郑鹏",
      "start_ms": 75879,
      "end_ms": 83719,
      "duration_ms": 7840,
      "text": "罗斯福接受了竭力兜售的计划 进攻 欧洲柔软的下腹部",
      "audio_file": "603b15dd-672d-4d8c-9f98-8721feff1363.wav",
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "speaker_id": "pw_320",
      "speaker_name": "林峰",
      "start_ms": 84039,
      "end_ms": 90279,
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "text": "你的歌让我的心都软了 最终华晨宇凭借 神作",
      "audio_file": "965a81eb-fe14-4734-ae2b-fa0f0ccb1751.wav",
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1219",
      "speaker_name": "梁芬",
      "start_ms": 90732,
      "end_ms": 99372,
      "duration_ms": 8640,
      "text": "很少有球员像内内这般能够在比赛中打得如此激情并且富有效率",
      "audio_file": "27eb3c29-8571-4c76-a3b8-05e648ff8d0a.wav",
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "speaker_id": "pw_468",
      "speaker_name": "朱敏",
      "start_ms": 100025,
      "end_ms": 108425,
      "duration_ms": 8400,
      "text": "土耳其足球运动员一九八三年 足球运动员一九八四年",
      "audio_file": "970b22bd-621b-4944-8477-396a81cfef35.wav",
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1044",
      "speaker_name": "郭小华",
      "start_ms": 108743,
      "end_ms": 117143,
      "duration_ms": 8400,
      "text": "也有许多人造的太空船和太空垃圾有这种轨道",
      "audio_file": "a9891ac1-d41e-4fd0-b04d-f47f859d8cac.wav",
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "speaker_id": "pw_1045",
      "speaker_name": "高伟",
      "start_ms": 117582,
      "end_ms": 124542,
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "text": "他认为 国家图治 就要求君主要善用 同时臣下必须遵法",
